Subject: [PATCH 04/17] invariant: every panel carries per-series metadata, and
 macro is bitemporal

ReturnPanel, AnalyticsPanel and VintagePanel behind one loader interface. Each
series carries true daily start, tier, hedge flag, gross/net flag and splice
record, because the frequency and lookahead vetoes cannot be evaluated without
them. VintagePanel.as_of returns the latest vintage knowable at a date; reading
frame directly and filtering by real_date is the lookahead the veto catches.
